1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
广东最讲究的一道鸡，什么都不加
Guangdong's proudest chicken adds nothing.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,900
不放酱料，只用清水浸熟
No sauce — just poached in clear water.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,400
广东人一句话：无鸡不成宴
A Canton saying: no chicken, no feast.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,900
这道菜，清代就有了
The dish dates back to the Qing.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
越简单，越考火候
The simpler it looks, the harder the timing.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,900
皮要爽、肉要滑、刚断生
Crisp skin, silky meat, just cooked through.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,400
蘸的只是姜葱和油盐
The dip? Just ginger, scallion, oil.

8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,900
一只好鸡，自己就够鲜
A good chicken needs nothing more.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,400
什么都不加，才最难
Adding nothing is the hardest part.

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,300
关注，带你尝遍一只鸡
Follow — one chicken, every way.
